# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**$Z$ Gate**: Adds a \"phase\" to a state (a prefactor, which in the cases of the Z eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ either a 1, or -1, respectively). Single-qubit gate.\n"
